@startuml F3.5-D03-aprovar-lote
title F3.5-D03 — Aprovar formativas em lote
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "FormativeController" as Ctrl
participant "BatchApproveUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Confirmar lote
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /formativas/batch-approve
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
note right of UC
  só EVENTO_INTERNO_PRESENCA_VALIDADA;
  inválidos excluídos do batch
end note
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE N itens\n+ event_log\n+ outbox por item
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: lote aprovado

@enduml
